10. (Currently Amended) The control system of claim 8, wherein one of the first and second torque sources has a faster wheel torque response capability than the other and when one of the first and second torque requests, but not the other, is satisfiable, the relative variation is dependent on the relationship:MTSon=MTSTotal-MTSoff;

